# Input

```scss
.opaque-filter{filter:progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.gradient(enabled='false',startColorstr='#fff',endColorstr='#000');filter:progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Shadow(color='#042b47',Direction=45,Strength=6) progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Shadow(color='#042b47',Direction=135,Strength=6);color:red;}

.filter-comments{filter:/* before */progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.gradient(startColorstr='#fff',/* between */endColorstr='#000')/* after */;width:calc(1px  +  2px);}

.suppressed-filter{
// biome-ignore format: preserve opaque filter spacing
filter:   progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Shadow(color='#042b47',Direction=45,Strength=6);
color: red;
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
.opaque-filter {
	filter: progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.gradient(enabled='false',startColorstr='#fff',endColorstr='#000');
	filter: progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Shadow(color='#042b47',Direction=45,Strength=6) progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Shadow(color='#042b47',Direction=135,Strength=6);
	color: red;
}

.filter-comments {
	filter:/* before */ progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.gradient(startColorstr='#fff',/* between */endColorstr='#000') /* after */;
	width: calc(1px + 2px);
}

.suppressed-filter {
	// biome-ignore format: preserve opaque filter spacing
	filter:   progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Shadow(color='#042b47',Direction=45,Strength=6);
	color: red;
}

```

